{
   "theme":"尋找物品",
   "data": {
       "phase1": [
            {
               "text":"今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
               "text":"kainu mʉcʉkʉhlicu a salia tumahlaʉ muricucu arinani",
               "textCh":"媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956375",
               "image":"girl.png",
               "background":"1-1.png"
            },
            {
               "text":"alukala ahlalua hlahlusa arinani, kuhlaisai tumahlaʉ a cucu’u mʉcʉkʉhlʉ.",
               "textCh":"今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956376",
               "image":"mom.png",
               "background":"1-2.png"
            },
            {
               "text":"tam masasangarʉ! rahluuacu kuakita hlakana’ana.",
               "textCh":"好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956377",
               "image":"girl.png",
               "background":"1-1.png"
            },
            {
               "text":"kuhlaisai! kupipasamia cucumʉmʉa arinani, tumalʉlʉviau cucumʉmʉa.",
               "textCh":"對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956378",
               "image":"mom.png",
               "background":"1-2.png"
            },
            {
               "text":"aa’ʉ, macahliaku",
               "textCh":"好的，我一定會！",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956379",
               "image":"girl.png",
               "background":"1-1.png"
            },
            {
               "text":"tumuaku maialalangʉ uruamiaisa cacalaisa cucuvanana.",
               "textCh":"我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956380",
               "image":"mom.png",
               "background":"1-2.png"
            },
            {
               "text":"tumalʉlʉviaku!",
               "textCh":"我來幫忙！",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956381",
               "image":"girl.png",
               "background":"1-1.png"
            },
            {
               "text":"aa’ʉ, muaramau!",
               "textCh":"好，你跟我來！",
               "sound":"text/sound/68830/956382",
               "image":"mom.png",
               "background":"1-2.png"
            }
